{"v":4,"catch":"咬、刺、踢、丟！ 讓我們聽到勝利者的怒吼！","desc":"《Dinorex》是TAITO於1992年發行的格鬥遊戲。\n從 6 種可用恐龍中進行選擇並進行戰鬥，贏得亞馬遜女王和霸王龍的稱號：陸地之王！\n獲得各種類型的蛋形物品和武器可以讓你在戰鬥中獲得優勢。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-11-16","genres":["格鬥","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b2b1f583f9de2bae2696a1a1d4a25aa2924cdd339255c801c722fbcc9776564.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/047fbc29e7cd661ce33dd806c99b392d8d52bb5a2c1eaf1a51fd8441761ae57e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6775bbf3a96ab95d21caaa3f383f1c4841db264fb48b11859c90e18744dc8969.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a87fbf1095bb87ceb4a2b9fb307a1ad347e17007e380c49b11935cde1fe9cac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed4a004f912b288239e0ca18c88eda3b7d2c976b1afa6fee4c7bc217c1526e00.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0eded5af6fdd68e3ae406a52ccf1eced12b6ec66da08a80fb83c10d108945c2f.jpg"],"titleId":"0100879019c60000","dlc":[]}